      "evidence_refs": [
        "https://prpm.dbp.gov.my/Cari1?d=72508&keyword=dangkal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "subject": "Final relation",
      "conclusion": "“Different-common-word” is too categorical for this card. A relation such as preferred-overlap or shared-synonym-preference would better represent dangkal as the Indonesian default and cetek as the Malaysian preference without implying exclusivity.",
